        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p>Every wound taken all fight arrives at once as growth.</p><p><strong>30-foot emanation</strong>, basic Fortitude, <strong>force</strong> damage.</p><p>You gain temporary Hit Points equal to <strong>twice your level</strong>. At the start of your next turn the emanation detonates a second time for <strong>half</strong> the Waning dice.</p><hr /><p><strong>&#9888; Extrapolated</strong> &mdash; growing stronger from damage is Gerard's canon Schrift.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
